Package: recueil
Title: Client for the 'Recueil' Reference Manager
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("R.", "Heller", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "58561665+r-heller@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Reads a 'Recueil' library over its REST API as data frames: items, the
    analytics tables, the citation graph as 'tidygraph' or 'igraph' objects, and the
    library as a 'bibliometrix' data frame through 'convert2df', so 'biblioshiny' and
    the 'bibliometrix' analyses run on it unmodified. Exports networks for 'VOSviewer'
    and 'Gephi'. For systematic reviews, returns the 'PRISMA2020' counts, the risk-of-bias
    table 'robvis' reads and extraction data in the shape 'metafor' takes.
License: file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
